[121.809064,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  One live binding, one diagnosed link failure\r\n  ============================================\r\n\r\n  Profile and peer opt-in were loaded in one SSH candidate.\r\n  The evidence comes from actual BFD transitions and the BGP peer,\r\n  not a canned timer message. Restoring the link restores both sessions.\r\n\r\n  The PID printed before and after belongs to the same shown Ze process.\r\n"]
